8124.description:
This is a sequel to the popular game Ground Control, released back in 2004. Despite its direct connection to the original, the sequel doesn't repeat its plot, but offers a new one. At the same time, the 2019 game has been updated with virtually everything in line with the times: graphics, animation, tactics, and combat system.

In this game, you become involved in a three-way conflict. You choose two of three factions and begin fighting for them, completing mission after mission. Ground Control 2 is a stunning blend of retro flair and modern capabilities, making it suitable for both those who loved the first game and those who have never tried tactical strategy games before.

Features:

a very flexible camera – you will have a view from above, but you will be able to control it and configure it as you like; Each faction has its own characteristics – technology, appearance, unique skills and combat techniques, and you can try them all; Each participant in the conflict has their own motivation – join those who are closer to you; There is a multiplayer mode in which you can compete with your friends, as well as a single player mode for completing missions; The futuristic plot captivates you from the very first minutes of the game – you will want to know everything about this world; The graphics are very well designed – you will visit realistic deserts, jungles and snowy expanses.
By the way, the game takes place in the year 2471. Who will you side with: the intergalactic democrats using living organism nanotechnology or the aggressive representatives of humanity? You can download the torrent from our website. Ground Control 2: Operation Exodus on PC, choose a side and join the battle!

Installation:
1. Mount the GCII_CD1 and GCII_CD2 images;
2. Write the serial key from serial.txt;
3. Install the patch;
4. Replace gcii.exe in the game folder with the one in the NoCD folder;
5. Let's play.
